  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759252,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 101-in-1 Party Megamix - Nintendo Wii\n\nGet ready for a non-stop party with *101-in-1 Party Megamix*! This Wii extravaganza delivers a massive collection of 101 mini-games, offering endless entertainment for players of all ages. From classic favorites like Snake and Sudoku to exciting jigsaw puzzles and a variety of other challenges, there's something for everyone.\n\nDive into eight differently-themed channels, competing for high scores to unlock new games and earn bonus prizes to personalize your player profiles. The \"Zapping\" mode provides instant access to any unlocked game, while \"Marathon\" mode lets up to four players battle it out in a series of five randomly selected games. \n\nWhether you’re tackling the challenges solo or engaging in a family competition, *101-in-1 Party Megamix* guarantees hours of laughter and excitement. With the ability to save up to four player profiles, everyone can track their individual progress and strive to unlock every last game in this ultimate party collection."
    },
